  "title": "TScan Therapeutics Announces Positive Initial Data from Cohort C of Ongoing ALLOHA™ Phase 1 Study Evaluating TSC-101 in Patients with Heme Malignancies Undergoing Allogeneic Hematopoietic Cell Transplantation",
